	<h1>Getting started</h1>
	<norn-rich-text>
		<p>The list nests one level for each heading level, from the second to the sixth. Each link points to a heading in this same page, so selecting one scrolls to it. Keep the headings short, and let the list name the sections in the order they appear.</p>
		<norn-heading-anchor @slug="install">Install</norn-heading-anchor>
		<p>The contents sit in a column beside the page and follow it as it scrolls. The link for the section in view takes the accent, so a reader can tell where they are.</p>
		<norn-heading-anchor @slug="with-npm" :@level="3">With npm</norn-heading-anchor>
		<p>Each link points to a heading in this same page, so selecting one scrolls to it. Keep the headings short, and let the list name the sections in the order they appear.</p>
		<norn-heading-anchor @slug="pinned" :@level="4">Pinned versions</norn-heading-anchor>
		<p>The contents sit in a column beside the page and follow it as it scrolls. The link for the section in view takes the accent, so a reader can tell where they are.</p>
		<norn-heading-anchor @slug="ranges" :@level="5">Version ranges</norn-heading-anchor>
		<p>Each link points to a heading in this same page, so selecting one scrolls to it. Keep the headings short, and let the list name the sections in the order they appear.</p>
		<norn-heading-anchor @slug="carets" :@level="6">Caret ranges</norn-heading-anchor>
		<p>The contents sit in a column beside the page and follow it as it scrolls. The link for the section in view takes the accent, so a reader can tell where they are.</p>
		<p>Each link points to a heading in this same page, so selecting one scrolls to it. Keep the headings short, and let the list name the sections in the order they appear.</p>
